# Claude Code parses YAML frontmatter in these files. A CRLF `---\r\n` fence defeats that
# parse and the affected agent/skill silently fails to register — no error, no warning, the
# worker is simply absent at spawn time. That is how chimera-deep-extractor and
# chimera-paper-triager sat unreachable from L.B.2 until the L.B.6 gate run found them.
#
# This repo runs with core.autocrlf=true, which would restore CRLF on every checkout and
# re-break them. Pin these to LF so the fix survives a fresh clone.
.claude/agents/*.md text eol=lf
.claude/skills/**/*.md text eol=lf
